    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/d58216632e36f97ae6a87f6c00604c18.avif?t=1749850880\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU DO NOT EXIST IS A SCI-FI ROGUELITE SET IN THE NEAR FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the efforts of major corporations, humanity has expanded across the inner solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime and civil unrest have increased to uncontrollable levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars is on the brink of revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concerned with recent blows dealt to galactic expansion, the governments of Earth and Mars responded with the establishment of humanity\u2019s largest-ever bounty hunting social program: <strong>Bounties&amp;Hunters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the state of the future as Birdy, a small-time bounty hunter seeking a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/5cdf3aecb3e7e38cfe98588204ea9971.poster.avif?t=1749850880\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/5cdf3aecb3e7e38cfe98588204ea9971.webp?t=1749850880\" class=\"bb_img\" width=563 height=331 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE PROGRAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <i>Bounties&amp;Hunters</i>, you will be able to pick up jobs to earn funds towards new equipment and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Mars and beyond in dungeon-crawler-esque levels where each encounter is its own unique sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/66c79686b8a6c400528f09f072c35f44.avif?t=1749850880\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new friends, or face off against rivals and the criminal underworld in intense orthographic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is as it seems. Make decisions that can permanently alter the fate of Birdy's story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/6a0601c48bcf379e23c443d7e3c2bf6a.avif?t=1749850880\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/d58216632e36f97ae6a87f6c00604c18.avif?t=1749850880\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU DO NOT EXIST IS A SCI-FI ROGUELITE SET IN THE NEAR FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the efforts of major corporations, humanity has expanded across the inner solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime and civil unrest have increased to uncontrollable levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars is on the brink of revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concerned with recent blows dealt to galactic expansion, the governments of Earth and Mars responded with the establishment of humanity\u2019s largest-ever bounty hunting social program: <strong>Bounties&amp;Hunters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the state of the future as Birdy, a small-time bounty hunter seeking a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/5cdf3aecb3e7e38cfe98588204ea9971.poster.avif?t=1749850880\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/5cdf3aecb3e7e38cfe98588204ea9971.webp?t=1749850880\" class=\"bb_img\" width=563 height=331 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN THE PROGRAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <i>Bounties&amp;Hunters</i>, you will be able to pick up jobs to earn funds towards new equipment and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Mars and beyond in dungeon-crawler-esque levels where each encounter is its own unique sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/66c79686b8a6c400528f09f072c35f44.avif?t=1749850880\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new friends, or face off against rivals and the criminal underworld in intense orthographic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is as it seems. Make decisions that can permanently alter the fate of Birdy's story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719690/extras/6a0601c48bcf379e23c443d7e3c2bf6a.avif?t=1749850880\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>",
